     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\">Every learner is different. We help families explore individualized learning goals and structured lesson plans tailored to a learner’s interests, abilities, communication preferences, and support needs.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></p>"
